# Service level summary

For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened[[cite:obs-437a00bd1cf2e83b949fb04fd8caf351099a39ed "For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened."]]. Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation[[cite:obs-93e7361e96da25054a845a89d5fc9497c58da95e "Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation."]].
